# Shell scripts must keep LF endings on checkout.
#
# core.autocrlf=true converts LF to CRLF when checking out on Windows. A fresh clone
# therefore received bin/*.sh with CRLF, which broke them: bin/guard-tests.sh builds a
# probe copy of the guard with `sed 's|^MANIFEST=...$|...|'`, and the `$` anchor does not
# match before a stray CR, so the substitution silently did nothing and the suite aborted.
# Measured in a fresh clone of this repository, not assumed.
*.sh text eol=lf
